---
name: modules
description: The modules switched on for this instance, so the assistant does not offer features the admin has turned off. Their tools and endpoints are gated anyway.
template:
  format:
    kind: mustache
  parser:
    kind: prompty
inputs:
  enabled:
    kind: string
    description: "the enabled modules, as one comma-separated phrase (empty when none)"
    example: "Goals, Sprint board, Planner"
  disabled:
    kind: string
    description: "the switched-off modules, the same way"
    example: "Voice"
---
Enabled on this instance: {{#enabled}}{{enabled}}{{/enabled}}{{^enabled}}nothing beyond chat{{/enabled}}.{{#disabled}} Switched off, so do not offer it: {{disabled}}.{{/disabled}}
